# PR label rules.
#
# Format (one rule per line):
#     <glob> -> <label>[,<label>...] [ -> <priority> ]
#
#   * matches within a single path segment; ** spans directories;
#   a pattern without a "/" matches the basename at any depth.
#   Priority is an optional integer (default 0). When rules overlap, labels
#   with a higher priority are listed first.

docs/**     -> documentation -> 10
*.md        -> documentation -> 10
src/api/**  -> api,backend   -> 30
src/**      -> source        -> 5
*.test.*    -> tests         -> 50
.github/**  -> ci            -> 20
*.yml       -> ci            -> 20
*.yaml      -> ci            -> 20
